    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To consume a message from a managed subscription or queue, I need to select a concrete external provider. Amazon Simple Queue Service (SQS) is a suitable choice for this task. I will write Python code that uses the Boto3 library to interact with SQS. The code will identify the provider by importing the Boto3 library and using the SQS client. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
